# ACL broker B-Monitor. Akun baru tanpa baris di sini = tidak punya akses (default tolak).
# Backend: akses penuh ke semua topik tambak.
user bmonitor_backend
topic readwrite tambak/#

# Gateway hardware: hanya kirim sensor + ack, dan terima perintah.
user hw_gateway
topic write tambak/+/sensor
topic write tambak/+/sensor/#
topic write tambak/+/actuator/status
topic write tambak/+/vision
topic read tambak/+/actuator/command
